---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Leadership — Conatus Real Estate Inc."
  description="Meet the leadership behind Conatus Real Estate Inc. — deep operational expertise in single-family residential real estate combined with AI-native technology development."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="page-label">Leadership</p>
      <h1>Built by <span class="accent">operators</span></h1>

      <div class="leader-profile">
        <div class="leader-info">
          <h2>Ted Farry</h2>
          <p class="leader-title">Founder & Principal</p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose">
          <p class="lead">
            Ted Farry founded Conatus Real Estate Inc. to bridge the gap between
            deep operational expertise and modern technology. His career spans both
            sides of the equation — building and operating real estate platforms at
            scale, then applying AI-native development practices to solve the same
            problems he lived as an operator.
          </p>

          <h3>Operational Background</h3>
          <p>
            Ted's operational experience is rooted in single-family residential real estate.
            He has built and operated platforms that executed over 4,000 SFR transactions
            across multiple markets, deploying more than $1B in acquisitions capital. This
            work covered the full SFR lifecycle — acquisitions, asset management, disposition,
            and compliance — giving him a ground-level understanding of the operational
            complexity that generic software tools fail to address.
          </p>
          <p>
            His asset management experience is specifically in SFR portfolios, including
            Housing Choice Voucher (HCV) lease-ups, housing authority coordination,
            inspection management, and compliance operations. This isn't theoretical
            knowledge — it's the result of managing real portfolios with real tenants
            and real regulatory requirements.
          </p>

          <h3>Technology & AI</h3>
          <p>
            Ted recognized early that the operational bottlenecks in regulated industries
            aren't solved by off-the-shelf SaaS products. The problems are too specific,
            the compliance requirements too nuanced, and the workflows too interconnected
            for generic tools. The answer is purpose-built platforms — and now, AI makes
            it possible to build them faster and make them smarter.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every platform Conatus builds leverages Claude's intelligence through MCP
            integrations, autonomous agent workflows, and AI-driven analysis pipelines.
            Ted's development practice is AI-native: Claude isn't an add-on to the
            development process, it's core infrastructure for both building platforms
            and powering them in production.
          </p>

          <h3>Approach</h3>
          <p>
            Ted's consulting approach starts with understanding the operational reality
            on the ground before writing a line of code. Technology should serve operations,
            not the other way around. The result: platforms that operators actually use,
            built by someone who has been the operator.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="leader-contact">
          <a href="mailto:houses@conatusre.com" class="btn btn--primary">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .leader-profile {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .leader-info {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .leader-info h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .leader-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .leader-contact {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
</style>
